# Extra hostnames the Vite dev server may answer on (comma-separated).
# localhost, *.localhost and IPs are always allowed by Vite itself.
# NEVER replace this with `allowedHosts: true` — that disables the
# Host-header check and exposes your source via DNS rebinding
# (GHSA-vg6x-rcgg-rjx6). Examples:
#   .e2b.app           — container preview environments
#   .trycloudflare.com — quick tunnels
VITE_ALLOWED_HOSTS=
